[38;5;231m⏺[39m Added a checkbox to [38;5;153mindex.html:19[39m.

  - A [38;5;153m<label class="task">[39m wraps the [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m and its text, so clicking either the box or the label
    toggles it.
  - The native checkbox carries the on/off state — no JS needed.
  - A [38;5;153m:checked + span[39m rule strikes through the text when marked done.

  One sample item ("Write the report") is included as a placeholder; duplicate the [38;5;153m<label>[39m block for more items.

